llowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio. </span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Proofread the sentence. </span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Click on the incorrect word. </span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.</span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary. </span>"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob04re4aud01"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 10}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn11le12ob04re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Make a list of minimal pairs."}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le12ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Welcome! Are you here to check in?<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Yes. We reserved two rooms. My secretary has also sent a few special requests by e-mail.<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Let me see. There's no reservation under either name. <br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Impossible. This has been in the works for months. Could you check under BFP, please?<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Ahh, there we go. You have one room booked.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> There must have been some mistake. We definitely booked two rooms. I haven't shared a room since I was in college.<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> It says here that a request was made. It says, \u201cwe'd like to share.\u201d<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Chair, not share. It was requested that an office chair be provided, because we are going to be working from the room. <br>", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le12ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "44000", "text": "<span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Oh, I see, so you're sure you don't want to share? It might strengthen your working relationship.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Yes, I'm absolutely sure we don't want to share.  <br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Now, about the clam chowder that was mentioned in your email,  we normally don't serve ...<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> It says that I wanted a warm shower, not clam chowder! Why in the world would I want clam chowder?<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> We couldn't figure it out either. And then it was pointed out that you are from Boston. We assumed you must have wanted a little taste of home.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Well, you assumed wrong, I'm afraid. It must have been an autocorrect mistake. My secretary sent the e-mail from her cellphone.<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Right. Now, I notice that a tree tower was mentioned. We have a strict \u201cno tree tower\u201d policy. <br><span class=strong>Adam:</span>  Are you kidding me? I said I want three towels, not a tree tower. What is a tree tower, anyway?", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le12ob04re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "98000", "text": "<span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> One of our bellhops claimed that it's a sort of tree house, where people from Boston go to eat clam chowder.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Ummm, no.<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Okay, now that we've got that straightened out, here's your key. The thrash band is already in the room, rehearsing.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span>  A thrash band? Playing thrash metal? In my room! My god, I'm afraid to ask.<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> It's written here, sir. \u201cOne thrash band beside the desk, please.\u201d<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> A trash bin, for garbage! <br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> We thought it was a Boston thing.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Of course you did. Well, thanks anyway.<br><span class=strong>Receptionist:</span> Did you say tanks? I'm afraid we don't allow those, either.<br>", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le12ob04re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob04re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}